    "text": "## sub_4DF110_004df110 — ContactConstraintSolverUpdate\n\n**Summary:** Updates wheel contact constraint data — finds insertion slot by depth threshold, processes soft deformation and hard limits on contact vertex positions, computes face normals. Core of tire-ground contact solver.\n\n**Frame-path:** ON_FRAME_PATH  \n**Call frequency:** per-frame tick\n\n**Called by:** SortedArrayInsertWithLRUEviction (004dedb0), StateArrayReset (004e3890), MultiObjectRemove (004e3a50)\n\n**Struct fields accessed:**\n\n| Base | Offset | R/W | Init (literal → value) | Purpose |\n|------|--------|-----|------------------------|---------|\n| this | 0x0 | RW | — | Current contact depth/sort key value |\n| this | 0x8 | R | — | Number of vertex contact groups |\n| this | 0xC | R | — | Pointer to group descriptor array |\n| this | 0x10 | R | — | Number of secondary contact entries |\n| this | 0x14 | R | — | Pointer to secondary contact data array |\n| this | 0x18 | R | — | Number of sorted contact entry slots |\n| this | 0x20 | R | — | Start of sorted contact entries (9 floats each) |\n\n**Written-by note (persistence):**\n- this 0x0: recalc every frame — external poke does NOT persist\n\n**Globals referenced:**\n\n| Address | Name | R/W | Role |\n|---------|------|-----|------|\n| 0059e430 | dbl_59E430 | R | ZeroSentinel [DERIVED] (also: ` (ZeroSentinel ~0.0) |\n| 0059e43c | flt_59E43C | R | physics constant [DERIVED] (also: ` — float threshold for contact aging overflow) |\n| 0059e440 | flt_59E440 | R | ZeroThreshold (~0.0f, physics clamp) [DERIVED] |\n| 0059e46c | flt_59E46C | R | TireSlipOffset [DERIVED] (also: ` — offset value) |\n| 0059e670 | flt_59E670 | R | SentinelFlagConstant [DERIVED] |\n| 0059ef78 | flt_59EF78 | R | ContactNormalizationFactor [DERIVED] (also: ` — second threshold/reference value) |\n| 005ad144 | flt_5AD144 | R | DeformationOffsetConst [DERIVED] (also: � offset constant for deformation) |\n| 005ad148 | flt_5AD148 | R | ContactProximityThreshold [DERIVED] |\n\n**Functions called:**\n\n| Address | Name | Purpose |\n|---------|------|---------|\n| 004dd9f0 | TriangleNormalComputation | Computes face normal from three contact triangle vertices |\n| 004de5d0 | sub_4DE5D0 | Retrieves vertex position from a contact face by index |\n\n**Guard conditions (deterministic — field vs literal):**\n\n| Base | Offset | Test | Value | Field / meaning |\n|------|--------|------|-------|-----------------|\n| this | 0x8 | <= | 0 | Number of vertex contact groups — skip if empty |\n| this | 0x8 | > | 0 | Groups exist, process group iterations |\n| this | 0x10 | > | 0 | Secondary contact count > 0, process secondary data |\n\n**Guard interpretation:** If this+0x8 (group count) <= 0, skips all group iteration and processing. If > 0, enters main processing loop over groups. If this+0x10 (secondary count) > 0, additionally iterates secondary contact array. PASSES: groups exist (-> process contact data). BLOCKED: no groups (-> skip immediately).\n"
